bottomparticipants
actor User
boundary "Comment Section (UI)" as UI
boundary Router
control CommentController
control CommentService
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Click Downvote
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. POST /downvote
activate Router

Router -> CommentController: 3. downVote(comment_id, req)
activate CommentController

CommentController -> CommentController: 4. Check token / role
activate CommentController
space
deactivate CommentController

loop Token / Role Invalid
    CommentController --> Router: 4.1 401 / 403 Error
    Router --> UI: 4.2 Show error
    UI --> User: 4.3 Error message
end

CommentController -> CommentService: 5. downVote(comment_id, payload)
activate CommentService

CommentService -> CommentService: 6. checkUser(payload)
activate CommentService
space
deactivate CommentService

loop User not exist / User is banned
    CommentService --> CommentController: 6.1 Error
    CommentController --> Router: 6.2 400 Error
    Router --> UI: 6.3 Show error
    UI --> User: 6.4 Error message
end

ref over User, MongoDB: 3.47.b.i. Subsequence - Vote comment 1